// Trino placeholder model ("fake object"). Edit and save: it hot-reloads.
// A flat river stone (the showcase's stepping stones and spring): a
// six-sided slab, ~24 triangles instead of the rock's 70 — every one is
// CPU T&L on the N64.
(
    shape: Cylinder(radius: 0.6, height: 0.6),
    color: (112, 114, 122, 255),
    top_color: Some((150, 152, 160, 255)),
    pivot: Center,
    segments: 6,
    smooth: false,
)
